    - id: frog
      name: "\uAC70\uB300 \uB450\uAEBC\uBE44"
      portrait: {fileID: 2214074101722377964, guid: aa1a3a3f0c736bc48ba995795659e3e9, type: 3}
      description: "\uC8FC\uD669\uC0C9\uC758 \uD53C\uBD80\uB97C \uAC00\uC9C4 \uAC70\uB300
